<tr height="50" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="1" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial">{!Contact.FirstName},</font>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr height="300" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r2" locked="0" aEditID="c1r2" >
<![CDATA[<div><div><font face="arial">Thank you for your inquiry regarding our BS Health Care Innovation program.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">As the face of healthcare continues to change across a national and global scale, it is important for educational institutions to prepare students for the future of health. The College of Nursing and Health Innovation aims to prepare lifelong, dynamic learners who are able to adapt and overcome complex challenges involved with health.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">The BS in Health Care Innovation is the first of its kind in the country, intended for students who want to lead transformative change in health through the creation of new products, processes and systems. The BS in Health Care Innovation is an interdisciplinary degree designed to prepare graduates to manage the implementation of health care innovation. This degree will provide students with a broad background in principles of innovation, leadership, complexity science, change theory, collaboration, and evidence-based decision making to prepare graduates to manage implementation of innovation in the health care arena.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">This is a unique degree that situates students at the intersection of innovation and entrepreneurship in health and healing. Graduates may be employed as entrepreneurs, intrapreneurs, practitioners, health system designers, health architects, health product or service managers, public relations experts in health, health care strategists, advisors, project managers, and/or administrators.</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><b>Program Requirements</b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style="font-family: arial;">To view the&nbsp;</font><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: medium;">BS Health Care Innovation&nbsp;</span><font face="arial" style="font-family: arial;">degree requirements and submit an application click&nbsp;</font><a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/programs/t5/majorinfo/ASU00/NUHCIBS/undergrad/false" target="_blank" style="font-size: medium;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">here</font></a><font face="arial" style="font-family: arial;">.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style="font-family: arial;">Our&nbsp;</font><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: medium;">BS Health Care Innovation</span><font face="arial" style="font-family: arial;">&nbsp;program is available on the&nbsp;</font><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: arial;"><a href="https://campus.asu.edu/downtown/" target="_blank" style="font-size: medium;">Downtown Phoenix campus</a>&nbsp;and the&nbsp;</font><a href="https://campus.asu.edu/west/" target="_blank" style="font-family: arial; font-size: medium;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">West campus</font></a><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: arial;">. To view the plan of study, please click&nbsp;</font><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-size: medium;"><a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/programs/t5/roadmaps/ASU00/NUHCIBS/null/ALL/2015" target="_blank" style="font-size: medium;">here</a>.</font><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">&nbsp;The c</font></font><font face="arial" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">ourse descriptions are hyperlinked within the major maps.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><b>Benefits of pursuing a degree with ASU</b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><ul><li>Growing your career and leading others</li><li>Gaining broader perspectives on integrative health approaches and practices</li><li>Surrounding yourself with expert faculty and quality mentors</li><li>Preparing to positively impact health outcomes</li><li>Applying theory and research to practice</li></ul></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Contact us to get started!</font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
